## Dispelling the Myth that UGC is Only for E-Commerce

B2B buyers are consumers during their off-hours. They scroll the same TikTok feeds and respond to the same human, conversational proof points.

B2B brands that replace stuffy whitepaper ads with casual, screen-in-screen walkthroughs ("Here is the exact tool our team uses to automate client reporting in 2 minutes") consistently see:
- **35% lower Cost Per Lead (CPL)** on LinkedIn and Meta.
- Significantly higher free trial activation rates.
- Stronger founder trust and viral organic shares.
